+  denied, workspace tests, docs/dependency/vector/rig gates and close-out audit.
+- Clean GitHub-HEAD (`2cf0321a83d6b308950a196b476ab086bf50c42c` + `0040-N0`)
+  apply and revalidation: [`clean-apply.txt`](clean-apply.txt).
